{"4557160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Guilty or Not", "steam_appid": 4557160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557160/extras/4745e3891ec05da32e01e4b180ffdb34.webp?t=1787220174\" width=345 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557160/extras/c1922137d2f3f7ef9f0405e1eeb2c6f8.poster.avif?t=1787220174\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557160/extras/c1922137d2f3f7ef9f0405e1eeb2c6f8.webm?t=1787220174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557160/extras/c1922137d2f3f7ef9f0405e1eeb2c6f8.mp4?t=1787220174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Every detail matters when reconstructing a crime. Carefully examine bodies and use forensic tools to uncover every hidden piece of evidence. Only you can put the pieces together. What caused the victim's death? What motive drove the killer? The truth is rarely as obvious as it seems.  <br>‎ ‎ ‎ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557160/extras/1f977ebc16a32481051f003402282fd5.webp?t=1787220174\" width=446 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557160/extras/a7a974c901d462516b902b3d7676c565.poster.avif?t=1787220174\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557160/extras/a7a974c901d462516b902b3d7676c565.webm?t=1787220174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557160/extras/a7a974c901d462516b902b3d7676c565.mp4?t=1787220174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>A calm conversation, persuasion, or the threat of a gun - the choice is yours. Every defendant and witness requires a different approach. Ask the right questions and dive deep into each case. Your understanding of the facts and attention to detail will help you expose lies and uncover contradictions.   <br>‎ ‎ ‎ ‎ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">‎<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557160/extras/0b928b460957c7c591b6479d2fe25da1.webp?t=1787220174\" width=351 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557160/extras/dae7e6418b9ea65761d34ad407951024.poster.avif?t=1787220174\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557160/extras/dae7e6418b9ea65761d34ad407951024.webm?t=1787220174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557160/extras/dae7e6418b9ea65761d34ad407951024.mp4?t=1787220174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extract hidden information from secured devices, carefully review case files, and examine every piece of evidence. Work with both physical and digital evidence to reconstruct the full sequence of events. Even the smallest clue can change the course of an investigation. Don't let the guilty escape justice.  <br>‎ ‎ ‎ ‎ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557160/extras/8b6b14e28d3921e739a16fe235904a4c.webp?t=1787220174\" width=366 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557160/extras/a245aeb973609d65b557611337d925c9.poster.avif?t=1787220174\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557160/extras/a245aeb973609d65b557611337d925c9.webm?t=1787220174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557160/extras/a245aeb973609d65b557611337d925c9.mp4?t=1787220174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evidence, witness statements, case files, the victim's body, and advanced forensic tools - you already have everything you need. Use deduction, reconstruct the timeline of events, connect every fact, uncover inconsistencies, and answer the one question that matters most: Guilty or Not?  <br>‎ ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557160/extras/792b5cdc9f2e926a6177976aa9d7a090.webp?t=1787220174\" width=327 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557160/extras/1830700703c161e60a39f76f4a0f6675.poster.avif?t=1787220174\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557160/extras/1830700703c161e60a39f76f4a0f6675.webm?t=1787220174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557160/extras/1830700703c161e60a39f76f4a0f6675.mp4?t=1787220174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for bribery attempts, death threats, and even violent attacks. Evidence that once seemed undeniable may fall apart, while trusted witnesses may reveal their darkest side. Stay vigilant as the story evolves based on your discoveries, keeping you on edge until the final strike of the judge's gavel. Remember: everyone's fate in this courtroom depends on your decisions. You are the judge, the jury, and the one who delivers the final verdict.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557160/extras/4745e3891ec05da32e01e4b180ffdb34.webp?t=1787220174\" width=345 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557160/extras/c1922137d2f3f7ef9f0405e1eeb2c6f8.poster.avif?t=1787220174\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557160/extras/c1922137d2f3f7ef9f0405e1eeb2c6f8.webm?t=1787220174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557160/extras/c1922137d2f3f7ef9f0405e1eeb2c6f8.mp4?t=1787220174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Every detail matters when reconstructing a crime. Carefully examine bodies and use forensic tools to uncover every hidden piece of evidence. Only you can put the pieces together. What caused the victim's death? What motive drove the killer? The truth is rarely as obvious as it seems.  <br>‎ ‎ ‎ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557160/extras/1f977ebc16a32481051f003402282fd5.webp?t=1787220174\" width=446 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557160/extras/a7a974c901d462516b902b3d7676c565.poster.avif?t=1787220174\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557160/extras/a7a974c901d462516b902b3d7676c565.webm?t=1787220174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557160/extras/a7a974c901d462516b902b3d7676c565.mp4?t=1787220174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>A calm conversation, persuasion, or the threat of a gun - the choice is yours. Every defendant and witness requires a different approach. Ask the right questions and dive deep into each case. Your understanding of the facts and attention to detail will help you expose lies and uncover contradictions.   <br>‎ ‎ ‎ ‎ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">‎<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557160/extras/0b928b460957c7c591b6479d2fe25da1.webp?t=1787220174\" width=351 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557160/extras/dae7e6418b9ea65761d34ad407951024.poster.avif?t=1787220174\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557160/extras/dae7e6418b9ea65761d34ad407951024.webm?t=1787220174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557160/extras/dae7e6418b9ea65761d34ad407951024.mp4?t=1787220174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extract hidden information from secured devices, carefully review case files, and examine every piece of evidence. Work with both physical and digital evidence to reconstruct the full sequence of events. Even the smallest clue can change the course of an investigation. Don't let the guilty escape justice.  <br>‎ ‎ ‎ ‎ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557160/extras/8b6b14e28d3921e739a16fe235904a4c.webp?t=1787220174\" width=366 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557160/extras/a245aeb973609d65b557611337d925c9.poster.avif?t=1787220174\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557160/extras/a245aeb973609d65b557611337d925c9.webm?t=1787220174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557160/extras/a245aeb973609d65b557611337d925c9.mp4?t=1787220174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evidence, witness statements, case files, the victim's body, and advanced forensic tools - you already have everything you need. Use deduction, reconstruct the timeline of events, connect every fact, uncover inconsistencies, and answer the one question that matters most: Guilty or Not?  <br>‎ ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557160/extras/792b5cdc9f2e926a6177976aa9d7a090.webp?t=1787220174\" width=327 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557160/extras/1830700703c161e60a39f76f4a0f6675.poster.avif?t=1787220174\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557160/extras/1830700703c161e60a39f76f4a0f6675.webm?t=1787220174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557160/extras/1830700703c161e60a39f76f4a0f6675.mp4?t=1787220174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for bribery attempts, death threats, and even violent attacks. Evidence that once seemed undeniable may fall apart, while trusted witnesses may reveal their darkest side. Stay vigilant as the story evolves based on your discoveries, keeping you on edge until the final strike of the judge's gavel. Remember: everyone's fate in this courtroom depends on your decisions. You are the judge, the jury, and the one who delivers the final verdict.</p>", "short_description": "Guilty or Not is a single-player detective simulator where you are the judge, the jury, and the law. Investigate cases, gather evidence, and interrogate suspects and witnesses to uncover the truth. Justice is in your hands, even if it ends in death... What will your final verdict be?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Spanish - Latin America, Turkish, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557160/95f8e410cbe51fdc37a2607d362e0e8ad151d1b9/header.jpg?t=1787220174", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557160/a332f429d503c681d5d580789d7f70ae7a177b9d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787220174", "